Note that the host timings for memory transfers seem to agree well 
with the NVidia profiler reports.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

NOTE : to see how NVidia CUDA devices do not conform to the basic math
       standards feel free to switch off the IEEE754 compliance options : 


dev$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -I../include -m64 -gencode arch=compute_35,code=sm_35 -Wno-deprecated-gpu-targets -c -o vmultd.o vmultd.cu
dev$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -m64 -gencode arch=compute_35,code=sm_35 -Wno-deprecated-gpu-targets -o vmultd vmultd.o -lgomp

